Refused: a definition linked by x-method and x-side to a method no meta file
lists, which would become a plain type with its method never wired
(0019-PLAN-generator-hardening.md, G18).

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}, "protocolMethods": {"cancel_request": "$/cancel_request"}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "OrphanThingNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "agent", "x-method": "orphan/thing"},
  "CancelRequestNotification": {"type": "object", "x-side": "protocol", "x-method": "$/cancel_request"}
}}
-- want.err --
definition OrphanThingNotification:
linked by x-method and x-side to agent method "orphan/thing", which no meta file lists
